<title>HONG KONG: Major non-China HK/Asia air traffic in Dec.</title>
<headline>Major non-China HK/Asia air traffic in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Taipei and Tokyo's Karita airports continued as the most important routes for Hong Kong's air cargo imports and exports in December,,figures published by the Civil Aviation Department show.</p>
